# API reference

Every public object in {{ package_name }} is listed here. Adding a public
object means adding it to this page too; `make docs-check` fails otherwise.

The listing below is written as reStructuredText inside an `eval-rst` block,
because autosummary finds the objects to document by scanning the source text
for `.. autosummary::`. It does not recognise the MyST spelling of the same
directive, and the stub pages are then silently never generated.

## Sequence statistics

```{eval-rst}
.. currentmodule:: {{ module_name }}

.. autosummary::
   :toctree: api/_autosummary
   :nosignatures:

   gc_content
```
